From: Charlie Bruce
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] configure: build adpcm_ima_hvqm4 without --enable-gpl

FFmpeg's configure marks the adpcm_ima_hvqm4 decoder "lgpl_gpl": files licensed under the LGPL that "some
developers prefer only building ... with --enable-gpl" (configure's own comment). The decoder is in
libavcodec/adpcm.c, licensed under the LGPL 2.1 or later. This removes that one line so the LGPL build has it.

Changed by Charlie Bruce for the nightfire-cxbx project, 26 October 2026.
Applies to FFmpeg n8.1.3.

diff -uN a/configure b/configure
--- a/configure
+++ b/configure
@@ -3074,7 +3074,6 @@
 adpcm_g722_encoder_select="g722dsp"
 adpcm_ima_escape_decoder_deps="lgpl_gpl"
 adpcm_ima_hvqm2_decoder_deps="lgpl_gpl"
-adpcm_ima_hvqm4_decoder_deps="lgpl_gpl"
 adpcm_ima_magix_decoder_deps="lgpl_gpl"
 adpcm_ima_pda_decoder_deps="lgpl_gpl"
 adpcm_n64_decoder_deps="lgpl_gpl"
